{"step_index":65,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-17T19:28:39Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Updated walkthrough.md summarizing the Modern Clean Light Eco-Tech transformation of NexusMobility\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# Walkthrough: NexusMobility — Modern Clean Light Eco-Tech Platform\\n\\n**NexusMobility** has been completely re-themed and upgraded into a **Modern Clean Light Eco-Tech** urban transit platform inspired by Apple Mobility and Tesla Sustainability interfaces.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🌟 Key Upgrades & Transformations\\n\\n1. **Modern Clean Light Eco-Tech Theme**:\\n   - Soft Slate Gray background (`#F4F7F6`).\\n   - Pure White Glass panels (`#FFFFFF`) with subtle emerald border glows.\\n   - Urban Emerald Green (`#059669`) for active status, eco-badges, and CO₂ metrics.\\n   - Clean Electric Blue (`#2563EB`) for action CTAs, route corridors, and interactive canvas vectors.\\n   - Energy Amber (`#D97706`) for priority standby lounge slots.\\n   - High-contrast Deep Charcoal (`#0F172A`) headings and Cool Slate (`#64748B`) metadata.\\n\\n2. **Interactive 4-Seat Visual Car Blueprint**:\\n   - Replaced basic numeric input with an interactive top-down vehicle chassis diagram.\\n   - Users can visually click and toggle individual seats (`FRONT`, `REAR L`, `REAR R`) between Active (Green) and Reserved/Off.\\n\\n3. **Route Compatibility Matching Engine**:\\n   - Calculates intelligent corridor overlap and displays live match scores (e.g. `96% Route Match`) on active shared trip cards.\\n\\n4. **Flexible Identity & Booking Verification**:\\n   - Search bar supports both numeric Driver IDs (`#101`) and alphanumeric Booking References (`NX-501`, `BK-201`) with instant verified status display.\\n\\n5. **Official Eco-Transit Journey Receipt**:\\n   - Click \\\"Eco-Receipt\\\" on any active trip card to trigger a clean printable modal detailing carbon offset, distance, travel time, and fare breakdown.\\n\\n6. **Refined 3D Anti-Gravity Tilt Physics**:\\n   - Smooth 60fps mouse-following perspective tilt (`perspective(1000px) rotateX(...) rotateY(...) translateZ(10px)`) with leak-free event handling.\\n\\n7. **Zero Academic CS / Data Structure Jargon**:\\n   - 100% natural transit logistics semantics.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📁 Source Files\\n- **Application**: [index.html](fi\n<truncated 529 bytes>","Description":"\"Updated walkthrough.md for NexusMobility Light Eco-Tech upgrade\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Kartik Bhosle\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Writing file\"","toolSummary":"\"Update walkthrough.md for NexusMobility Light Eco-Tech upgrade\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
