{"step_index":79,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-17T19:40:23Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Updated README.md documentation for NexusMobility clean 4-tabbed multi-view enterprise layout.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# 🌿 NexusMobility — Multi-Tabbed Enterprise Eco-Tech Platform\\n\\n> An enterprise-ready, production-grade web application for intelligent urban transit, carpooling, and metropolitan carbon emissions reduction. Designed with a clean, high-contrast light theme, 4 focused primary views, dynamic commuter fare splitting slider, interactive 4-seat visual car diagram, gamified partner badges, and zero computer science/academic data structure jargon.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🎨 Clean Light Eco-Tech Palette\\n\\n- **Primary Background**: Soft Slate Gray (`#F4F7F6`)\\n- **Card Surface & Panels**: Pure White Glass (`#FFFFFF`) with subtle emerald border glows\\n- **Sustainability Accent**: Urban Emerald Green (`#059669`) for active status, eco-badges, and CO₂ metrics\\n- **Primary Action Accent**: Clean Electric Blue (`#2563EB`) for route corridors, primary CTA buttons, and interactive maps\\n- **Priority Standby Accent**: Energy Amber (`#D97706`) for priority lounge slots and warnings\\n- **Dark Typography**: Deep Charcoal (`#0F172A`) for high-contrast, crisp readability\\n- **Muted Typography**: Cool Slate (`#64748B`) for subtext and metadata\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📑 4-Tabbed Page Architecture\\n\\nThe platform is structured into **4 dedicated, non-cluttered views** with smooth animated transitions:\\n\\n```text\\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│ [1. Eco-Route Finder & Map] [2. Commuter Hub] [3. Fleet & Dispatch] [4. Sustainability]│\\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\\n```\\n\\n### Tab 1: \\\"Eco-Route Finder & Map\\\" (Focus: Navigation & Commute Planning)\\n- **Interactive 3D M\n<truncated 3441 bytes>","Description":"\"Updated README.md for NexusMobility multi-tabbed platform\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Kartik Bhosle\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a\\\\README.md\"","toolAction":"\"Writing file\"","toolSummary":"\"Update README.md for multi-tabbed platform\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
