{"step_index":81,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-17T19:40:36Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Updated walkthrough.md summarizing the multi-tabbed layout reorganization of NexusMobility\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# Walkthrough: NexusMobility — Clean Multi-Tabbed Enterprise Layout\\n\\n**NexusMobility** has been completely reorganized from a single crowded dashboard into a clean, 4-tabbed enterprise layout with smooth view transitions, dynamic interactive controls, and dedicated focus areas.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🌟 4-Tab Reorganization Summary\\n\\n1. **Tab 1: \\\"Eco-Route Finder & Map\\\"**:\\n   - Focus: Navigation, 3D corridor visualization, and dynamic commute planning.\\n   - Interactive 3D metropolitan corridor map with drag-to-orbit and zoom controls.\\n   - Origin & Destination station selectors with automatic eco-route computation.\\n   - **Dynamic Commuter Density Slider (1 to 4 Passengers)**: Allows users to slide between *1 Solo*, *2 Pooled*, *3 Pooled*, and *4 Max Pool*, instantly recalculating the fare split per seat, carbon savings multiplier, and solo cars removed.\\n\\n2. **Tab 2: \\\"Commuter Passenger Hub\\\"**:\\n   - Focus: Commuter ride booking and dispatch queue operations.\\n   - Dedicated passenger ride request form.\\n   - Live passenger dispatch conveyor pipeline with priority indicators (`Next Dispatch`, `Priority #2`).\\n   - Priority Standby Lounge (5 Slots) with 3D rotating ring buffer, usage indicator (`0/5` to `5/5`), and overflow limits.\\n\\n3. **Tab 3: \\\"Driver Fleet & Dispatch Console\\\"**:\\n   - Focus: Driver partner operations, vehicle capacity, and active trips.\\n   - Split grid containing driver onboarding with the **interactive top-down 4-seat vehicle blueprint** (click seats to toggle availability).\\n   - Live fleet directory stream showing partner cards and free seat counts.\\n   - Active shared trips console with route compatibility badges (e.g. `96% Route Match`).\\n   - Flexible identity search bar supporting both numeric Driver IDs (`#101`) and alphanumeric Booking References (`NX-501`, `BK-201`).\\n   - \\\"Revert Last Confirmation\\\" instant trip undo control.\\n\\n4. **Tab 4: \\\"City Sustainability Analytics\\\"**:\\n   - Focus: Environmental and enterprise metrics.\\n   - Net CO₂ emissions reduced (kg), singl\n<truncated 1226 bytes>","Description":"\"Updated walkthrough.md for multi-tabbed layout reorganization\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Kartik Bhosle\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Writing file\"","toolSummary":"\"Update walkthrough.md for multi-tabbed layout\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
