arm.\r\n\r\n7. Professional Enterprise Alert Modals:\r\n   - Replace standard text toasts for major booking actions with professional modal dialogs for:\r\n     - Ride Booking / Dispatch Confirmation (showing driver ID, route corridor, fare split, and CO2 saved with an \"Acknowledge\" CTA button).\r\n     - Trip Cancellation / Reversal Alerts (showing restored seat capacity and passenger status).\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nEnsure all 4 tabs remain clean, modular, and 100% free of academic/backend CS jargon.\n</USER_REQUEST>\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-18T01:23:45+05:30.\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>"}
