{"step_index":99,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-17T19:59:15Z","content":"All visual, interactive, and user experience enhancements for **NexusMobility — Smart City Eco-Logistics** have been completed:\n\n---\n\n### 🌟 Summary of Upgrades Delivered\n\n1. **Clean Header & Navigation**:\n   - Removed the \"Export Package (.ZIP)\" button.\n   - Streamlined down to primary controls: **\"Rush-Hour Simulation\"** and **\"Book Eco-Ride\"**.\n\n2. **Smooth 2D Micro-Lifting Hover**:\n   - Removed the heavy 3D perspective mouse-tracking tilt effect to eliminate card stuttering and dizziness.\n   - Replaced with a smooth 2D micro-lifting hover transition (`transform: translateY(-4px)` with soft emerald/slate drop-shadows).\n\n3. **Enhanced Spatial Map with Directional Flow & Station Indicators**:\n   - Directional chevron energy pulses animate along active corridors indicating transit flow from Origin to Destination.\n   - Distinct station node indicators with hub icons and clear zone metadata tags.\n\n4. **Animated Car Running Across Spatial Map Routes**:\n   - An electric transit vehicle drives smoothly along route corridor waypoints with glowing headlight beams and headlight trails upon route calculation or trip dispatch.\n   - Added a **\"Drive Route\"** action button in Tab 1 to re-run the simulation on demand.\n\n5. **Ambient Eco-Particle Background Layer**:\n   - Slow-drifting eco-leaves (with gentle sway and rotation) and soft electric blue energy nodes floating upwards across `#ambient-canvas`.\n\n6. **Friendly Eco-Mascot Character (\"EcoSprout\")**:\n   - An illustrated sprout mascot wearing aviator driving goggles and a leaf cap featured in empty state containers across the passenger queue, fleet directory, and active trips stream.\n\n7. **Professional Enterprise Alert Modals**:\n   - **Trip Dispatched Modal**: Displays trip reference, commuter name, driver partner, corridor alignment %, travel time, pooled fare, carbon offset, and a **\"View on Route Map\"** action button.\n   - **Trip Reversal Modal**: Details safe rollback confirmation, restored driver seat capacity, and commuter queue priority restoration.\n\n---\n\n### 📂 Direct File Access\n\n- 📄 **Application**: [index.html](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/index.html)\n- 🎨 **Styles & Animations**: [styles.css](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/styles.css)\n- ⚙️ **Transit Engine & Mascot Controller**: [app.js](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/app.js)\n- 📖 **Operating Manual**: [README.md](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/README.md)\n- 📋 **Walkthrough Summary**: [walkthrough.md](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/walkthrough.md)\n\nOpen [index.html](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/index.html) in your browser to experience the smooth 2D hover elevation, animated car transit simulation on the 3D map, ambient background particles, and EcoSprout mascot!"}
